Devices per campus:

Every campus: 1× Cisco 2960 Layer 2 switch + 2 PCs
Campus 6 (Master): 1× Cisco 3560 Multilayer Switch (this is your core router)
Campus 3 (Entry): Add 1× Server (AAA/RADIUS)
Campus 25 (Storage): Add 1× Server (file server)

Cabling:

All campus 2960 switches → uplink to the Cp6 3560 via trunk links (use straight-through between switches)
PCs → their local 2960 switch via straight-through cables
Servers → their local campus switch
